# Maven build output
target/
!**/src/main/**/target/
!**/src/test/**/target/

# The Maven wrapper is kept (mvnw, .mvn/wrapper/*) so the project builds without Maven installed

# Environment and local settings. The OpenAI key lives in the shared .env one folder up, never in this project.
